This repository is an original LIN implementation of the published
StableSwap invariant (Egorov, "StableSwap - efficient mechanism for
Stablecoin liquidity", 2019) as used by Curve 3pool get_D / get_y / get_dy.

It is NOT a copy, fork, or redistribution of curvefi/curve-contract Vyper
source. That upstream LICENSE grants no redistribution right; auditors
should fetch the pinned commit from GitHub themselves.

